# Local development only — template for supabase/functions/.env
#
# 1. Copy this file to supabase/functions/.env   (that file is git-ignored)
# 2. Fill in values locally. Never commit the filled-in file.
#
# Production: set the same names as Supabase Edge Function secrets
# (Supabase dashboard → Edge Functions → Secrets, or `supabase secrets set`).
# Never put these values in frontend/, in README files, or in any committed file.

